    <heading level="1">Everyday Math</heading>
    <exercise number="496" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Average cost Pictures Plus produces digital albums. The company’s average cost (in dollars) to make $$x$$ albums is given by the expression $$\frac{7x + 500}{x}$$ .</paragraph>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>ⓐ Find the quotient by dividing the numerator by the denominator.</item>
          <item>ⓑ What will the average cost (in dollars) be to produce 20 albums?</item>
        </list>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="497" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Handshakes At a company meeting, every employee shakes hands with every other employee. The number of handshakes is given by the expression $$\frac{n^{2} - n}{2}$$ , where $$n$$ represents the number of employees. How many handshakes will there be if there are 10 employees at the meeting?</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>45</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
